{"id":"wb-3-48","name":"千佛崖造像（包括龙虎塔、九顶塔）","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"千佛崖造像 (济南)","text":"千佛崖造像，位于山东省济南市历城区，位于神通寺遗址白虎山腰的石壁上。现存石窟100余孔，210身佛像，分布在长100米的石壁之上，年代多为初唐。1988年1月13日和龙虎塔、九顶塔一道以千佛崖造像的名义列入第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F_(%E6%B5%8E%E5%8D%97)","revisionId":88058054,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88058054","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/38a46e38f9ada55c61cad1b6.jpg","title":"Thousand_buddha_cliff_shandong_2006_09_1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Thousand_buddha_cliff_shandong_2006_09_1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/50/Thousand_buddha_cliff_shandong_2006_09_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Rolf Müller (User:Rolfmueller)","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"Photograph of carved sculptures on the Thousand Buddha Cliff in Shandong Province, China.","width":320,"height":213}}